[{"i": "b63ede36", "t": "What is the closest value of √4√27 + 3", "o": ["4.6", "4.3", "4.9", "5.2"], "a": 2, "e": "Let <img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p8730/image002.png\">\nx<sup>2</sup> = 4√27 + 3\n= 12√3 + 3\n= 12 * 1.732 + 3\n= 23.784\nNow,\n<b>From option (a):</b>\nSquare of 4.6 = 4.6 * 4.6 = 21.16\n<b>From option (b):</b>\nSquare of 4.3 = 4.3 * 4.3 = 18.49\n<b>From option (c):</b>\nSquare of 4.9 = 4.9 * 4.9 = 24.01\n<b>From option (d):</b>\nSquare of 5.2 = 5.2 * 5.2 = 27.04\nSince, 24.01 is closest to x<sup>2</sup>, then option (c) is the correct answer.", "h": "√4√27 + 3 का निकटतम मान"}, {"i": "d6d1a213", "t": "Let a = (√3 + 1) / (√3 - 1). Simplify a + 1/a.", "o": ["2", "4", "6", "8"], "a": 1, "e": "· First, rationalize a:\na = [(√3 + 1)/(√3 - 1)] X [(√3 + 1)/(√3 + 1)]\n= ( (√3 + 1)² ) / (3 - 1)\n= (3 + 2√3 + 1) / 2\n= (4 + 2√3) / 2\n= 2 + √3.\n· Then 1/a = 1 / (2 + √3). Rationalize again:\n1 / (2 + √3) X [(2 - √3)/(2 - √3)] = (2 - √3) / (4 - 3) = 2 - √3.\n· So a + 1/a = (2 + √3) + (2 - √3) = 4.", "h": "मान लीजिए a = (√3 + 1) / (√3 - 1)। a + 1/a को सरल कीजिए।"}, {"i": "48ba1d42", "t": "If 81 * 27<sup>(m + 2)</sup> = 3<sup>n</sup>, and 3125<sup>(n + 3)</sup> * 125<sup>4</sup> = 5<sup>m</sup>, then which of the following is correct?", "o": ["m = 13/2 and n = 11/2", "m = 11/2 and n = 13/2", "m = -11/2 and n = -13/2", "m = -13/2 and n = -11/2"], "a": 2, "e": "81 * 27<sup>(m + 2)</sup> = 3<sup>n</sup>\n=> 3<sup>4 + 3(m + 2) </sup>= 3<sup>n</sup>\n=> 4 + 3m + 6 = n\n=> 3m - n + 10 = 0----(1)\nAnd 3125<sup>(n + 3)</sup> * 125<sup>4</sup> = 5<sup>m</sup>\n=> 5<sup>5(n + 3) + 12</sup> = 5<sup>m</sup>\n=> 5n + 15 + 12 = m\n=> 5n - m + 27 = 0---(2)\nSolving equations (1), and (2), we get\nm = -11/2 and n = -13/2", "h": "यदि 81 * 27<sup>(m + 2)</sup> = 3<sup>n</sup>, तथा 3125<sup>(n + 3)</sup> * 125<sup>4</sup> = 5<sup>m</sup>, तो निम्न में से कौन सा सही है?", "oh": ["m = 13/2 और n = 11/2", "m = 11/2 और n = 13/2", "m = -11/2 और n = -13/2", "m = -13/2 और n = -11/2"]}, {"i": "a68b2171", "t": "If a = b<sup>3,</sup> b = c<sup>1/3,</sup> c = d<sup>2</sup> and d = e<sup>1/2</sup> then find a x b x c x d x e.", "o": ["a<sup>22/3</sup>", "a<sup>31/6</sup>", "a<sup>2</sup>", "a<sup>23/6</sup>"], "a": 3, "e": "a x b x c x d x e\n= a x b x c x d x d<sup>2 </sup>(as d = e<sup>1/2 </sup>so, e = d<sup>2</sup>)\n= a x b x c x d<sup>3</sup>\n= a x b x c x c<sup>3/2</sup> (as c = d<sup>2 </sup>so, d = c<sup>1/2</sup>)\n= a x b x c<sup>5/2</sup>\n= a x b x b<sup>15/2 </sup>(as b = c<sup>1/3 </sup>so, c = b<sup>3</sup>)\n= a x b<sup>17/2</sup>\n= a x a<sup>17/6 </sup>(as a = b<sup>3 </sup>so, b = a<sup>1/3</sup>)\n= a<sup>23/6</sup>\n<sup> </sup>", "h": "यदि a = b<sup>3,</sup> b = c<sup>1/3,</sup> c = d<sup>2</sup> और d = e<sup>1/2</sup> है, तो a x b x c x d x e ज्ञात करें।"}, {"i": "596db1eb", "t": "What value should come in place of the question mark?\n(64)<sup>8</sup> * (4)<sup>-32</sup> * (16)<sup>12</sup> ÷ (2)<sup>-18</sup> * (4)<sup>22</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup>", "o": ["84", "63", "94", "89"], "a": 2, "e": "(64)<sup>8</sup> * (4)<sup>-32</sup> * (16)<sup>12</sup> ÷ (2)<sup>-18</sup> * (4)<sup>22</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup>\n[(2)<sup>6</sup>]<sup>8 </sup>* 1/(4)<sup>32 </sup>* (2)<sup>48</sup> * (2)<sup>18</sup> * (2)<sup>44</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup>\n[(2)<sup>48</sup> * (2)<sup>48</sup> * (2)<sup>18</sup> * (2)<sup>44</sup>)/(2)<sup>64</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup>\n(2)<sup>48 + 48 + 18 + 44 - 64 </sup>= (2)<sup>?</sup>\n? = 48 + 48 + 18 + 44 - 64 = 94", "h": "प्रश्न चिह्न के स्थान पर क्या मान आना चाहिए?\n(64)<sup>8</sup> * (4)<sup>-32</sup> * (16)<sup>12</sup> ÷ (2)<sup>-18</sup> * (4)<sup>22</sup> = (2)<sup>?</sup>"}, {"i": "42b59ea1", "t": "If M√11 - N√13 = √99 +√52 -√208 +√176 and M and N are rational numbers, then what is the value of M<sup>2</sup> - N<sup>2</sup>?", "o": ["40", "45", "42", "44"], "a": 1, "e": "M√11 -N√13 = √99 +√52 -√208 +√176 = 3√11 + 2√13 -4√13 + 4√11\n= 7√11 -2√13\nBy comparing coefficients of LHS and RHS\nWe get\nM =7 and N =2\nM<sup>2</sup>-N<sup>2 </sup>= 49 - 4 = 45", "h": "यदि M√11 - N√13 = √99 +√52 -√208 +√176 तथा M और N परिमेय संख्याएँ हैं, तो M<sup>2</sup> - N<sup>2</sup> का मान कितना है?"}, {"i": "8267d34f", "t": "Simplify the following: 11 + √48 + √72 + √24", "o": ["(√2 + √6 + √5)<sup>2</sup>", "(√5 + √2 + √7)<sup>2</sup>", "(√5 + √6 + √3)<sup>2</sup>", "(√6 + √2 + √3)<sup>2</sup>"], "a": 3, "e": "We know, (a + b + c)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2 </sup>+ b<sup>2 </sup>+ c<sup>2</sup> + 2ab + 2bc + 2ac\nHere, 11 + √48 + √72 + √24\n= (√6)<sup>2</sup> + (√2)<sup>2 </sup>+ (√3)<sup>2</sup> + 2 (√6√2 + √6√3 + √3√2)\n= <b>(√6 + √2 + √3)<sup>2</sup></b>", "h": "निम्नलिखित को सरलीकृत कीजिए : 11 + √48 + √72 + √24"}, {"i": "f3445a77", "t": "(9)<sup>6</sup> ÷ ((9)<sup>2.5</sup> X (81)<sup>1.5</sup>)", "o": ["4", "3", "2", "1"], "a": 1, "e": "(9)<sup>6</sup> ÷ ((9)<sup>2.5</sup> X (81)<sup>1.5</sup>) = (9)<sup>6</sup>/(((9)<sup>2.5</sup> X (81)<sup>1.5</sup>))\n(3)<sup>12</sup>/(((3)<sup>2.5 X 2</sup> X (3)<sup>6</sup>))= 3<sup>12</sup>/(3<sup>5</sup> X 3<sup>6</sup>) = 3<sup>(12-11)</sup>=3"}, {"i": "e2a6682e", "t": "Solve (X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>-4</sup>/X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>3</sup>) * (X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>/X<sup>-5</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>) ÷ (X<sup>-4</sup>Y<sup>-1</sup>/X<sup>2</sup> Y<sup>2</sup>) = ?", "o": ["X<sup>13</sup> Y<sup>-4</sup>", "X<sup>13</sup>Y<sup>-3</sup>", "X<sup>-13</sup>Y<sup>3</sup>", "X<sup>13</sup> Y<sup>4</sup>"], "a": 0, "e": "(X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>-4</sup>/X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>3</sup>) * (X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>/X<sup>-5</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>) ÷ (X<sup>-4</sup>Y<sup>-1</sup>/X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup>) = (X<sup>-1</sup>Y<sup>-7</sup>) ) * (X<sup>8</sup>Y<sup>0</sup>) ÷ (X<sup>-6</sup>Y<sup>-3</sup>)\n= (X<sup>7</sup>Y<sup>-7</sup>) ÷ (X<sup>-6</sup>Y<sup>-3</sup>) = X<sup>13</sup>Y<sup>-4</sup>", "h": "(X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>-4</sup>/X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>3</sup>) * (X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>/X<sup>-5</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>) ÷ (X<sup>-4</sup>Y<sup>-1</sup>/X<sup>2</sup> Y<sup>2</sup>) = ?, हल करें ?"}, {"i": "f7f3f48b", "t": "Find the mixed surd form of √1960.", "o": ["14√10", "3√5", "8√21", "9√10"], "a": 0, "e": "Multiple of 1960 = 2 * 2 * 2 * 5 * 7 * 7\n√1960 = √(2 * 2 * 2 * 5 * 7 * 7)\n= 2 * 7 * √(2 * 5)\n= 14√10", "h": "√1960 का मिश्रित कर्दम रूप ज्ञात कीजिए।"}, {"i": "9aa99036", "t": "If 2<sup>x</sup>+2<sup>x-1</sup>=24 then x<sup>x</sup>= ?", "o": ["625", "81", "256", "4"], "a": 2, "e": "2<sup>x</sup>+2<sup>x-1</sup>=24\n2<sup>x</sup>+ 2<sup>x</sup>/2=24 → 2<sup>x</sup> (1+1/2)=24\n2<sup>x</sup>=24 X 2/3=8 X 2=16\n2<sup>x</sup>=16 → 2<sup>x</sup>=2<sup>4</sup> →x=4\nTherefore 4<sup>4</sup> = 256", "h": "यदि 2<sup>x</sup>+2<sup>x-1</sup>=24 है, तो x<sup>x</sup>= ?"}, {"i": "2dee6018", "t": "What value replaces \"?\" in [(3<sup>4</sup> ÷ 9) + (5<sup>2</sup> ÷ 5)] + (? ÷ 2) = 30", "o": ["24", "28", "30", "32"], "a": 3, "e": "3<sup>4</sup> = 81; 81 ÷ 9 = 9\n5<sup>2</sup> = 25; 25 ÷ 5 = 5\n9 + 5 = 14\n14 + (? ÷ 2) = 30 => ? ÷ 2 = 16 => ? = 32", "h": "[(3<sup>4</sup> ÷ 9) + (5<sup>2</sup> ÷ 5)] + (? ÷ 2) = 30 में \"?\" के स्थान पर कौन सा मान आएगा?"}, {"i": "1196a58d", "t": "Evaluate for ?: [(√4096 ÷ 8) + (2<sup>4</sup> ÷ 2)] X ∛? = 48", "o": ["27", "8", "18", "15"], "a": 0, "e": "√4096 = 64; 64 ÷ 8 = 8\n2<sup>4</sup> = 16; 16 ÷ 2 = 8\n8 + 8 = 16\n16 X ∛? = 48 => ∛? = 3 => ? = 27", "h": "के लिए मूल्यांकन करें: [(√4096 ÷ 8) + (2<sup>4</sup> ÷ 2)] X ∛? = 48"}, {"i": "87e5f715", "t": "Simplify the given equation.\n(27<sup>2/3</sup> ÷ 8<sup>4/3</sup>) * (32<sup>4/5 </sup>÷ 81<sup>1/4</sup>)", "o": ["3", "6", "4", "9"], "a": 0, "e": "= (27<sup>2/3</sup> ÷ 8<sup>4/3</sup>) * (32<sup>4/5 </sup>÷ 81<sup>1/4</sup>)\n= (3<sup>2</sup> ÷ 2<sup>4</sup>) * (2<sup>4 </sup>÷ 3)\n= (3<sup>2-1</sup> ÷ 2<sup>4-4</sup>)\n= <b>3</b>", "h": "दिए गए समीकरण का सरलीकरण करें:\n(27<sup>2/3</sup> ÷ 8<sup>4/3</sup>) * (32<sup>4/5 </sup>÷ 81<sup>1/4</sup>)"}, {"i": "0f984ea4", "t": "Simplify:\n(∛ [∛ 343])<sup>3</sup> x (∛ [∛ 216])<sup>3</sup>", "o": ["56", "42", "∛42", "42<sup>3</sup>"], "a": 1, "e": "<img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p28447/image008.png\">\n<img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p28447/image009.png\">\n= 7 X 6\n= 42", "h": "सरलीकृत करें:\n(∛ [∛ 343])<sup>3</sup> x (∛ [∛ 216])<sup>3</sup>"}, {"i": "0e6d2f46", "t": "The value of the expression 2√54 - √150 + 2√24 lies between:\nI. 10.5 to 11.5\nII. 11.5 to 12.0\nIII. 9.5 to 10.5\nIV. 12.0 to 12.5", "o": ["I", "II", "III", "IV"], "a": 3, "e": "<img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image026.gif\">\n<img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image027.gif\">\n<img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image028.gif\">\n<img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image029.gif\">\n<img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image030.gif\"> (Approx)", "h": "व्यंजक 2√54 - √150 + 2√24 का मान किसके बीच में स्थित है?\nI. 10.5 से 11.5 के बीच\nII. 11.5 से 12.0 के बीच\nIII. 9.5 से 10.5 के बीच\nIV. 12.0 से 12.5 के बीच"}]